# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RUN WORKSPACE — this repo doubles as the run working directory.
# Every per-ticket artifact is ignored by BROAD rule, not by filename:
# a new artifact name must never be one `git add -A` from a commit.
# (That recipe is banned in MAINTAINERS.md; commit explicit paths only.)
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Any per-ticket run artifact, any stage, any extension (EP-12345-*.*)
EP-*
# feature-scoped run artifacts (e.g. GS-API-V2-* call packs/runsheets)
GS-*
# …but pipeline intelligence stays tracked (Windows git matches EP-*
# case-insensitively, which would silently swallow these):
!ep-qa-pipeline-retrospective-*.md
!ep-qa-pipeline-proposed-edits*.md
# future layout: per-run folders
runs/

# stage outputs for non-EP ticket keys (belt and braces)
*-context.md
*-requirements.md
*-checklist.md
*-test-cases.md
*-pr-summary.md
*-code-review.md
*-api-testing.md
*-web-testing.md
*-run-report.md
*-run-analyzer.md

# local investigation / review working files
*-alpha-repro.md
*-flow-gap-analysis.md
*-remaining-cases-triage.md
*-results-archive.md
_vidframes/
.playwright-mcp/
.claude/

# generated data-pack / runsheet builders + repro scripts (embed fixture detail)
build_*.py
repro_*.py

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — never committed, anywhere in the tree
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*-testdata.json
*-testdata-notes.md
*-testdata.md
*-runsheet.xlsx
*-runsheet-*.xlsx
*-sample-runsheet.xlsx
*-manual-test-data-pack.xlsx
*-preserved-entries.tsv
*.diff
navigation_paths.json

# packaging
*.plugin

# fixtures are committed even though they match the patterns above
!fixtures/EP-*
!fixtures/*.md
